# ERP mock — Erp.Api (http://localhost:5101). Dati demo: docs/demo.md.
# Database: dotnet run --project tools/Dusiburg.AI.O2C.DbInit (lo ricrea con i dati demo).

@erp = http://localhost:5101
@correlationId = demo-fase1-001

### Giacenza di uno SKU disponibile
GET {{erp}}/api/stock/IND-BRG-001?quantity=40
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Giacenza con riserva: OnHand 12, Reserved 2 → 11 pezzi non disponibili
GET {{erp}}/api/stock/IND-MOT-002?quantity=11

### SKU inesistente (404, code NOT_FOUND)
GET {{erp}}/api/stock/IND-SEN-999?quantity=1

### Cliente per partita IVA (azienda C-01 del deal D-1001)
# @name customer
GET {{erp}}/api/customers?vatNumber=IT01234560157

### Cliente per email
GET {{erp}}/api/customers?email=acquisti@brambilla-om.it

### Nuovo cliente (azienda C-04 del deal D-1004); la seconda volta 409 CONFLICT
POST {{erp}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuova Robotica Marche S.r.l.",
  "vatNumber": "IT11234560422",
  "email": "acquisti@nuovaroboticamarche.it",
  "address": "Via dell'Artigianato 9, 60027 Osimo (AN)"
}

### Ordine del deal D-1001: la prima volta 201 con OrderNumber
# @name createOrder
POST {{erp}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "customerId": {{customer.response.body.$.customerId}},
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "IND-BRG-001", "quantity": 40, "unitPrice": 12.00 },
    { "sku": "IND-BRG-004", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 28.50 },
    { "sku": "IND-LUB-001", "quantity": 20, "unitPrice": 7.50 },
    { "sku": "IND-SEN-001", "quantity": 25, "unitPrice": 22.80 }
  ],
  "externalRef": "D-1001",
  "idempotencyKey": "o2c-D-1001-r1"
}

### Stesso ordine con la stessa chiave: 200 e stesso orderId, nessun duplicato
POST {{erp}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "customerId": {{customer.response.body.$.customerId}},
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "IND-BRG-001", "quantity": 40, "unitPrice": 12.00 },
    { "sku": "IND-BRG-004", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 28.50 },
    { "sku": "IND-LUB-001", "quantity": 20, "unitPrice": 7.50 },
    { "sku": "IND-SEN-001", "quantity": 25, "unitPrice": 22.80 }
  ],
  "externalRef": "D-1001",
  "idempotencyKey": "o2c-D-1001-r1"
}

### Lettura dell'ordine con le righe
GET {{erp}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.orderId}}

### Giacenza dopo l'ordine: Reserved di IND-BRG-001 passato da 20 a 60
GET {{erp}}/api/stock/IND-BRG-001?quantity=440

### Reset dei dati demo (solo Development): ordini cancellati, giacenze e clienti del seed
POST {{erp}}/dev/reset
